<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">kanashimi wa hoo wo tsutatte namida no kawa ni naru dake</font></font></b></font></font>

22
00:01:11,320 --> 00:01:18,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">and sadness will touch our cheeks, creating a river of tears</font></font></b></font></font>

23
00:01:18,490 --> 00:01:27,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">yureru omoi wa tsuyoi uzu ni n<font color="#ffffff">atte tokeau no yo</font></font></font></b></font></font>

24
00:01:18,490 --> 00:01:27,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">Trembling thoughts swept into a vortex and melting away</font></font></b></font></font>

25
00:01:42,200 --> 00:01:44,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll let you out of here.</font>

26
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:48,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And I'll grant you one wish too.</font>

27
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:50,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't have to worry.</font>

28
00:01:50,500 --> 00:01:55,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your strong will is going to remain
as Residual Aura inside me.</font>

29
00:01:56,760 --> 00:01:59,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not like you'll lose everything.</font>

30
00:02:03,010 --> 00:02:06,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then your flesh is mine.</font>

31
00:02:13,690 --> 00:02:16,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With this, Orochimaru-sama's body
has once again</font>

32
00:02:16,860 --> 00:02:19,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">become unable to reanimate
for several years.</font>

33
00:02:19,990 --> 00:02:21,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, there's a next time...</font>

34
00:02:25,370 --> 00:02:31,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-Indeed. My body no longer has value
as a vessel for Reanimation Jutsu.</font>

35
00:02:33,090 --> 00:02:36,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It will now be difficult for me
who has lost everything...</font>

36
00:02:36,340 --> 00:02:39,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to find my own calling.</font>

37
00:02:40,970 --> 00:02:43,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've finally understood that.</font>

38
00:02:46,560 --> 00:02:49,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if it's not me...</font>

39
00:02:49,100 --> 00:02:54,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll bring in the new "vessel"
even if it costs me my life.</font>

40
00:02:55,360 --> 00:02:58,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's my repayment to
Orochimaru-sama.</font>

41
00:03:00,320 --> 00:03:05,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's the only redemption for me...
who was worthless.</font>

42
00:03:06,870 --> 00:03:11,870
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Mistake!</font>

43
00:03:06,870 --> 00:03:11,870
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">A New Enemy</font>

44
00:03:24,250 --> 00:03:24,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're fast.</font>

45
00:03:33,930 --> 00:03:34,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akamaru.</font>

46
00:03:35,190 --> 00:03:37,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come quick after you've set the bombs!</font>

47
00:03:48,220 --> 00:03:49,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh no!</font>

48
00:03:54,620 --> 00:03:56,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— All right.
— Great.</font>

49
00:03:56,790 --> 00:03:58,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akamaru, well done.</font>

50
00:04:16,100 --> 00:04:17,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Messing with me.</font>

51
00:04:19,990 --> 00:04:20,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akamaru.</font>

52
00:04:21,030 --> 00:04:23,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't you "arf" me, you mutt!</font>

53
00:04:26,990 --> 00:04:28,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll waste you.</font>

54
00:04:34,500 --> 00:04:35,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hold on.</font>

55
00:04:35,670 --> 00:04:37,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You!</font>

56
00:04:50,530 --> 00:04:52,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kiba! Akamaru!</font>

57
00:04:53,450 --> 00:04:54,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it.</font>

58
00:05:20,450 --> 00:05:22,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's happening?</font>

59
00:05:24,300 --> 00:05:25,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You punks!</font>

60
00:05:26,640 --> 00:05:28,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where are Kiba and Akamaru?!</font>

61
00:05:28,560 --> 00:05:30,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Another one's come.</font>

62
00:05:32,260 --> 00:05:33,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We have no choice.</font>

63
00:05:33,570 --> 00:05:37,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll take care of this so you take
the coffin and go on ahead.</font>

64
00:05:38,220 --> 00:05:39,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shikamaru...</font>

65
00:05:39,210 --> 00:05:40,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Get going already.</font>

66
00:05:48,220 --> 00:05:50,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wh-Why are you...?</font>

67
00:06:24,790 --> 00:06:28,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry, Naruto.
It's my miscalculation.</font>

68
00:06:30,990 --> 00:06:32,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kimimaro.</font>

69
00:06:41,250 --> 00:06:44,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You were taking too long, Tayuya.</font>

70
00:06:47,790 --> 00:06:50,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And what happened to
the other three?</font>

71
00:06:52,090 --> 00:06:54,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Being none other than those
of the former "Sound Ninja Five."</font>

72
00:06:57,620 --> 00:06:59,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why are you...?</font>

73
00:07:00,260 --> 00:07:03,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your body... Your body's no longer...</font>

74
00:07:05,320 --> 00:07:11,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not moving with the flesh anymore.
It's mental power.</font>

75
00:07:13,730 --> 00:07:15,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Man, you cheater of death...</font>

76
00:07:16,490 --> 00:07:19,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I understand a little now
that feeling...</font>

77
00:07:19,620 --> 00:07:24,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">of being information that has escaped
from the prison of the flesh.</font>

78
00:07:31,470 --> 00:07:35,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The feeling of experiencing
a taste of Orochimaru-sama's dream.</font>

79
00:07:36,850 --> 00:07:38,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru...!</font>

80
00:07:39,270 --> 00:07:42,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This vessel... is an important vessel
for the dream...</font>

81
00:07:43,910 --> 00:07:47,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The flesh that Orochimaru-sama
truly desires.</font>

82
00:07:47,900 --> 00:07:50,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But you guys were a bit too late.</font>

83
00:07:55,280 --> 00:07:57,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Some dangerous guy
has appeared again.</font>

84
00:07:58,530 --> 00:08:01,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That air about him is
nothing ordinary.</font>

85
00:08:02,280 --> 00:08:05,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Anyway, we need
to sort out the situation.</font>

86
00:08:05,550 --> 00:08:07,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we were to carelessly
plunge in...</font>

87
00:08:07,170 --> 00:08:11,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You jerk.
What're you babbling nonsense?</font>

88
00:08:11,960 --> 00:08:12,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

89
00:08:12,800 --> 00:08:14,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Give back Sasuke!</font>

90
00:08:14,430 --> 00:08:15,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey wait!</font>

91
00:08:34,520 --> 00:08:35,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tayuya.</font>

92
00:08:37,180 --> 00:08:39,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The reason why I won't kill you now</font>

93
00:08:40,200 --> 00:08:44,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is because you have a mission
you have to complete.</font>

94
00:08:45,910 --> 00:08:51,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And my mission is to deliver
that to Orochimaru-sama.</font>

95
00:08:51,630 --> 00:08:53,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isn't it too late now?</font>

96
00:08:54,430 --> 00:08:56,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Humph. I told you.</font>

97
00:08:57,260 --> 00:09:01,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's the body that Orochimaru-sama
truly desires.</font>

98
00:09:01,990 --> 00:09:03,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The next vessel, huh?</font>

99
00:09:05,840 --> 00:09:07,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right...</font>

100
00:09:07,990 --> 00:09:11,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And this is the only thing that
I can do at present.</font>

101
00:09:12,810 --> 00:09:16,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I leave those two pieces
of garbage to you.</font>

102
00:09:22,620 --> 00:09:23,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke...</font>

103
00:09:24,410 --> 00:09:26,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That punk!</font>

104
00:09:26,120 --> 00:09:27,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Calm down, Naruto.</font>

105
00:09:27,500 --> 00:09:28,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How can I calm down?</font>

106
00:09:29,210 --> 00:09:32,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At this rate,
Sasuke will get far away again.</font>

107
00:09:35,900 --> 00:09:37,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto's right.</font>

108
00:09:38,200 --> 00:09:40,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is a mission to bring Sasuke back
to the Leaf Village.</font>

109
00:09:41,260 --> 00:09:44,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We must choose what would be
the most rational means</font>

110
00:09:44,810 --> 00:09:46,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to execute the mission.</font>

111
00:10:04,910 --> 00:10:06,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damned punks.</font>

112
00:10:06,120 --> 00:10:07,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll finish this in a flash.</font>

113
00:10:09,380 --> 00:10:10,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, listen up.</font>

114
00:10:11,950 --> 00:10:15,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please move according to the plan
that I'm going to tell you.</font>

115
00:10:23,520 --> 00:10:25,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's a classic close-range
combat-type fool</font>

116
00:10:26,220 --> 00:10:28,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with Shadow Clone Jutsu
as his only saving grace.</font>

117
00:10:29,200 --> 00:10:30,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And he's a middle-range
combat type</font>

118
00:10:31,060 --> 00:10:34,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who binds his enemies with
a Jutsu using shadows...</font>

119
00:10:34,480 --> 00:10:37,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and a sharp squad leader, huh?</font>

120
00:10:41,100 --> 00:10:42,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Got it?</font>

121
00:10:42,200 --> 00:10:43,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah.</font>

122
00:10:44,650 --> 00:10:46,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come on already you punks.</font>

123
00:10:48,600 --> 00:10:51,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's two versus one.
We've got the upper hand.</font>

124
00:10:51,290 --> 00:10:53,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's an opponent we can beat
if we team up.</font>

125
00:10:53,630 --> 00:10:54,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go, Naruto.</font>

126
00:10:54,840 --> 00:10:55,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right.</font>

127
00:10:56,990 --> 00:10:58,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With garbage like you jerks,</font>

128
00:10:58,800 --> 00:11:00,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it doesn't matter how many
of you are there.</font>

129
00:11:01,220 --> 00:11:03,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't underestimate our teamwork.</font>

130
00:11:03,720 --> 00:11:04,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go!</font>

131
00:11:09,310 --> 00:11:10,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bring it.</font>

132
00:11:12,810 --> 00:11:13,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now... Naruto.</font>

133
00:11:14,980 --> 00:11:16,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll blow you away.</font>

134
00:11:23,990 --> 00:11:26,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gotcha. The strategy is a success.</font>

135
00:11:26,990 --> 00:11:28,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Farewell.</font>

136
00:11:34,380 --> 00:11:35,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn.</font>

137
00:11:35,340 --> 00:11:36,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You tricked me.</font>

138
00:11:36,840 --> 00:11:40,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Teamwork, my ass. You little punks...</font>

139
00:11:47,260 --> 00:11:48,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn.</font>

140
00:11:52,140 --> 00:11:55,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You wouldn't fall for the same trick
over and over, huh..?</font>

141
00:11:56,320 --> 00:11:59,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Small fry... You've got nerve.</font>

142
00:12:00,440 --> 00:12:04,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, I guess I'll settle for just
having been able to let him get away.</font>

143
00:12:05,120 --> 00:12:06,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Remember this.</font>

144
00:12:06,940 --> 00:12:09,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not just Jutsu that are weapons.</font>

145
00:12:13,170 --> 00:12:15,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm counting on you, Shikamaru.</font>

146
00:12:23,130 --> 00:12:25,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hang in there, Sasuke.</font>

147
00:12:34,810 --> 00:12:36,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But that kid,</font>

148
00:12:36,560 --> 00:12:39,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">how wonderful it is that
he can move with that body, eh?</font>

149
00:12:39,780 --> 00:12:45,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kabuto, I don't know what kind
of order you gave him,</font>

150
00:12:45,160 --> 00:12:46,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but it's a bit harsh.</font>

151
00:12:47,950 --> 00:12:50,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not at all.
It wasn't an order.</font>

152
00:12:51,450 --> 00:12:55,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't like to force things.</font>

153
00:12:56,080 --> 00:12:58,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He acted on his own.</font>

154
00:13:00,500 --> 00:13:03,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For you whom he reveres.</font>

155
00:13:05,510 --> 00:13:10,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kabuto... You've really got
a hateful personality, don't you?</font>

156
00:13:10,890 --> 00:13:12,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru-sama.</font>

157
00:13:13,020 --> 00:13:17,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To you,
Kimimaro was a perfect existence...</font>

158
00:13:18,190 --> 00:13:21,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His thoughts were steeped in darkness
in the same way as yours.</font>

159
00:13:22,270 --> 00:13:24,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And he sanctified you.</font>

160
00:13:24,490 --> 00:13:27,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And he fanatically admired
and revered you.</font>

161
00:13:29,480 --> 00:13:34,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Moreover, he was of the Shinobi clan
with the strongest and perfect bodies</font>

162
00:13:35,200 --> 00:13:40,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">being the legitimate bloodline
of their Kekkai Genkai...</font>

163
00:13:41,350 --> 00:13:42,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">until a short time ago.</font>

164
00:13:43,590 --> 00:13:44,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes...</font>

165
00:13:45,340 --> 00:13:49,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When I think about having lost him
I still get a chill down my spine.</font>

166
00:13:50,970 --> 00:13:52,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I think about it even now...</font>

167
00:13:52,970 --> 00:14:00,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The man I truly wished for...
The body I wanted the most... Kimimaro.</font>

168
00:14:01,150 --> 00:14:04,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And if only he hadn't been stricken
with disease</font>

169
00:14:05,230 --> 00:14:07,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the assassination of the Hokage
would've gone smoother.</font>

170
00:14:08,240 --> 00:14:09,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Seal!</font>

171
00:14:20,770 --> 00:14:21,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My arms...</font>

172
00:14:22,200 --> 00:14:25,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now... you can no longer use
either of your arms...</font>

173
00:14:26,380 --> 00:14:28,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And since you can't use your arms</font>

174
00:14:28,840 --> 00:14:30,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you can't weave Sign...</font>

175
00:14:31,010 --> 00:14:34,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You no longer possess Ninjutsu!</font>

176
00:14:36,640 --> 00:14:40,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your ambition of crushing
the Hidden Leaf... dies right here!</font>

177
00:14:42,770 --> 00:14:45,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru, you fool...</font>

178
00:14:46,240 --> 00:14:51,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's unfortunate that we can't leave
together but my disciple...</font>

179
00:14:52,570 --> 00:14:55,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's meet in the other world
one day...</font>

180
00:15:25,820 --> 00:15:29,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke...
Sasuke-kun's not here yet?</font>

181
00:15:33,120 --> 00:15:36,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We wouldn't have needed to go
through such an experience.</font>

182
00:15:38,120 --> 00:15:44,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In the world very often things don't go
as we want them to.</font>

183
00:15:47,920 --> 00:15:52,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's only a matter of time,
Orochimaru-sama.</font>

184
00:16:06,220 --> 00:16:10,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When Tayuya... comes back
I'll kill her.</font>

185
00:16:11,610 --> 00:16:13,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hold it.</font>

186
00:16:15,300 --> 00:16:16,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey...!</font>

187
00:16:26,750 --> 00:16:29,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then, how shall I defeat you?</font>

188
00:16:45,480 --> 00:16:46,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You...</font>

189
00:16:47,560 --> 00:16:48,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those eyes...</font>

190
00:16:50,280 --> 00:16:53,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems he possesses
a peculiar Chakra.</font>

191
00:16:55,070 --> 00:17:00,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What does Orochimaru want to do...?
Why's he after Sasuke?</font>

192
00:17:07,920 --> 00:17:11,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru-sama has already
obtained Immortality Jutsu...</font>

193
00:17:12,420 --> 00:17:18,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A long time is necessary to get every Jutsu
and obtain everything in the world.</font>

194
00:17:18,720 --> 00:17:22,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What does that have to do
with Sasuke?!</font>

195
00:17:22,470 --> 00:17:27,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"Immortal" doesn't mean that
the flesh is being maintained as is...</font>

196
00:17:28,230 --> 00:17:30,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Before his body decays</font>

197
00:17:30,770 --> 00:17:34,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">a strong and new flesh will be made
into a vessel for his soul.</font>

198
00:17:35,780 --> 00:17:36,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's...</font>

199
00:17:37,530 --> 00:17:39,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you saying that's Sasuke?!</font>

200
00:17:41,160 --> 00:17:43,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes... That's right.</font>

201
00:17:45,120 --> 00:17:49,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't let such a thing happen!</font>

202
00:17:50,040 --> 00:17:55,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idiot... What will come of sending
one shrimp punk in pursuit?</font>

203
00:17:55,880 --> 00:17:58,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And looking at things
in terms of time</font>

204
00:17:59,710 --> 00:18:02,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">up until now you probably sacrificed
one member each time</font>

205
00:18:02,260 --> 00:18:05,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in order for the group
to move forward.</font>

206
00:18:08,690 --> 00:18:12,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that guy called Sasuke
that important?</font>

207
00:18:12,690 --> 00:18:17,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How many of your men do you intend
to sacrifice for the sake of just one person?</font>

208
00:18:18,610 --> 00:18:20,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You incompetent punk.</font>

209
00:18:23,540 --> 00:18:26,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Heh... Indeed...</font>

210
00:18:27,120 --> 00:18:31,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For me this is my first mission
as a platoon leader.</font>

211
00:18:31,750 --> 00:18:36,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's very disquieting having
comrades gradually whittled down</font>

212
00:18:36,770 --> 00:18:40,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and I didn't know if my own judgments
were correct or not.</font>

213
00:18:43,470 --> 00:18:47,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As a squad leader with
the lives of the party in my hands...</font>

214
00:18:47,780 --> 00:18:50,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">respecting the lives in
the four-member party</font>

215
00:18:50,550 --> 00:18:53,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">rather than the life of one person
taken by the enemy...</font>

216
00:18:54,420 --> 00:18:58,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and deciding to abort a mission
that's too dangerous would be by the book.</font>

217
00:18:59,380 --> 00:19:01,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then why didn't you do that?</font>

218
00:19:02,120 --> 00:19:06,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The world doesn't go
by the book very often...</font>

219
00:19:10,580 --> 00:19:13,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Since not one person in my squad
would do something like</font>

220
00:19:13,850 --> 00:19:20,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">abandon a captured comrade and give up
fighting for the sake of their own safety.</font>

221
00:19:23,050 --> 00:19:24,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Me included.</font>

222
00:19:28,390 --> 00:19:31,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Being the cloud-loving loafer myself,</font>

223
00:19:31,810 --> 00:19:35,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am not cut out to be a squad leader
who gives orders to comrades.</font>

224
00:19:36,940 --> 00:19:43,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The only thing I can do for them...
is to have faith in them.</font>

225
00:19:44,830 --> 00:19:48,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen. I'm not thinking anything
like they were sacrifices.</font>

226
00:19:49,040 --> 00:19:51,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not thinking anything
like they've died.</font>

227
00:19:53,750 --> 00:19:57,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't mock my comrades.</font>

228
00:20:02,340 --> 00:20:03,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I got you.</font>

229
00:20:07,600 --> 00:20:08,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Summoning Jutsu!</font>

230
00:20:25,280 --> 00:20:27,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This doesn't... look so good.</font>

231
00:20:30,120 --> 00:20:32,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll play a melody of death for you.</font>

232
00:20:32,960 --> 00:20:36,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't you mock us,
you damned punk.</font>

233
00:20:49,320 --> 00:20:51,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't let you take Sasuke
no matter what.</font>

234
00:20:52,980 --> 00:20:53,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Interesting.</font>

235
00:21:11,490 --> 00:21:14,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Baqa"><font size="28"><b><font color="#d0e2ad">hajimete kimi to shabetta</font></b></font></font></font>

236
