<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Baqa"><font size="28"><b><font color="#d0e2ad">for the first time I spoke to you</font></b></font></font></font>

237
00:21:14,240 --> 00:21:17,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Baqa"><font size="28"><b><font color="#d0e2ad">kimi wa waratte kureta</font></b></font></font></font>

238
