<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Damn it! What'll I do?!</font>

278
00:22:41,250 --> 00:22:43,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">He's trouble enough yet</font>

279
00:22:43,130 --> 00:22:45,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">his Chakra has increased
several ten-fold!</font>

280
00:22:46,260 --> 00:22:49,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">It's no good. I can't use it here yet.</font>

281
00:22:49,630 --> 00:22:51,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">But if I stay like this we'll...</font>

282
00:22:52,010 --> 00:22:53,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I get it, Akamaru.</font>

283
00:22:53,720 --> 00:22:55,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">It's like you said.</font>

284
00:22:55,600 --> 00:22:58,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I have no choice but to use it!</font>

285
00:22:58,810 --> 00:23:02,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next time:
"Roar! Howl! The Ultimate Tag."</font>

